 "THIEF": {
  "//": "The Thief (Battle Re-work Part 7). dual: each stab's damage with a dagger in both hands (two a round). poisonChance: the chance a coated hit poisons (Toxic: more); poisonStack: how many poisons stack (Virulence: 3). weakenChance: a weakening venom's chance a hit. smoke: rounds a smoke bomb blinds the creature. classes: who can coat a weapon (the rest learn it on a switch, Part 9).",
